## Troubleshooting APK Installation on Android

- Make sure you are installing the compiled **`.apk` file** (not the exported source `.zip` archive).
- In Android **Settings → Apps → Special app access → Install unknown apps**, allow installation for your browser or file manager.
- If upgrading over a differently signed build, uninstall the existing `Termux studio` app (`com.termux.studio`) before installing the new APK.
- If **Google Play Protect** prompts for a newly built debug APK, expand **More details → Install anyway**.

